OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 22 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: A Georgian
OL,5,     FChristmas
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod visits the home of
OL,7,     GJane Austen with historian Amanda
OL,8,     GVickery to discover some of the
OL,9,     Gseasonal customs and Christmas
OL,10,     Gmusic of late-Georgian Britain.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GKatie Derham and Petroc Trelawny
OL,13,     Gpresent the In Tune Christmas
OL,14,     GSpecial with music from The
OL,15,     GFourth Choir, Connaught Brass,
OL,16,     GCharles Owen and Katya Apekisheva
OL,17,     Gand Jacqui Dankworth.
OL,18,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,19,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,20,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
